sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser as Next.js browser app
    participant API as Go API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Mail as Resend API (optional)
    participant Middleware as JWT/role middleware

    User->>Browser: Submit registration form
    Browser->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register
    API->>DB: Transaction: pending user + organization + owner membership
    API->>DB: Store verification token
    API->>Mail: Send verification email when configured
    Note over API,Mail: Mail failure is logged; registration still returns a success-shaped response.
    Mail-->>User: Link points to /auth/verify?token=...
    Note over User,Browser: No frontend /auth/verify page exists.
    Note over API: The registered verification route is GET /api/v1/auth/verify.

    User->>Browser: Submit login form
    Browser->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login (email/password JSON body)
    API->>DB: Load user/password hash/status
    API->>API: Verify Argon2id password and require active status
    API->>DB: Load first organization membership
    API-->>Browser: JWT + user + organization
    Browser->>Browser: Persist token/user/org in Zustand localStorage

    User->>Browser: Call protected resource
    Browser->>API: Request with Authorization: Bearer JWT
    API->>Middleware: Verify signature, issuer, expiration, role
    Middleware->>Middleware: Put user/org/role claims in request context
    Middleware->>DB: Handler query is expected to scope by organization_id
    Note over Middleware,DB: No PostgreSQL RLS or composite tenant-aware FKs are configured.
    API-->>Browser: Resource response

    User->>Browser: Request password reset
    Browser->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password
    API->>DB: Store reset-purpose token
    API->>Mail: Send reset link when configured
    User->>Browser: Open /auth/reset-password?token=...
    Browser->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password
    API->>DB: Validate token and update password

